0068+  4026             CH_CMD_SET_RETRY: equ 0Bh
0069+  4026             CH_CMD_WRITE_VAR8: equ 0Bh
0070+  4026             CH_CMD_READ_VAR32: equ 0Ch
0071+  4026             CH_CMD_WRITE_VAR32: equ 0Dh
