0273+  4081                 ;Some devices (e.g. TEAC FD-05PUB) NAK the IN packets of a multi-packet data stage
0274+  4081                 ;on endpoint 0 for a short time, and the CH376 limited NAK retry mode gives up
0275+  4081                 ;too early for them. So during control transfers the CH376 is told to not retry NAKs
