0554+  41AB             ; --------------------------------------
0555+  41AB             ; _CH_IN_TOKEN: Execute an IN transaction, retrying on NAK if enabled
0556+  41AB             ;
0557+  41AB             ; Input:  A = Toggle bit in bit 7
0558+  41AB             ;         E = Endpoint number
