1542+  4457             
1543+  4457                 ;Bits 7 and 6:
1544+  4457                 ;  0x: Don't retry NAKs
1545+  4457                 ;  10: Retry NAKs indefinitely (default)
1546+  4457                 ;  11: Retry NAKs for 3s
1547+  4457                 ;Bits 5-0: Number of retries after device timeout
1548+  4457                 ;Default after reset and SET_USB_MODE is 8Fh
1549+  4457             
