1759+  450E             ; Send a token to the current target USB device
1760+  450E             ;
1761+  450E             ; Input: E = Endpoint number
1762+  450E             ;        B = PID, one of CH_PID_*
1763+  450E             ;        A = Toggle bit in bit 7 (for IN transfer)
