0080+  4600                 ;* Neither a FDD nor a storage device: print the appropriate error
0081+  4600             
0082+  4600             _VERBOSE_RESET_NO_STOR:
0083+  4600 F1              pop af
0084+  4601 C1              pop bc
0085+  4602 3D              dec a
