0319+  50AF DD E1           pop ix
0320+  50B1 C9              ret
0321+  50B2             
0322+  50B2             
0323+  50B2             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
0324+  50B2             ; Store the misc flags (lower four bits only)
