1262+  56A4             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1263+  56A4             ; USB_EXECUTE_CBI_WITH_RETRY: Execute a command using CBI transport with error retry
1264+  56A4             ;
1265+  56A4             ; Retried errors are those of type "device powered" or "not ready to
1266+  56A4             ; ready transition", plus optionally "media changed"
1267+  56A4             ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1268+  56A4             ; Input:  Same as USB_EXECUTE_CBI, plus:
1269+  56A4             ;         A = 1 to retry "media changed" errors, 0 to no retry them
1270+  56A4             ; Output: Same as USB_EXECUTE_CBI
1271+  56A4             
1272+  56A4             USB_EXECUTE_CBI_WITH_RETRY:
1273+  56A4 CD B2 56        call _USB_EXECUTE_CBI_WITH_RETRY
