1372+  56FA DD F9           ld sp,ix
1373+  56FC             
1374+  56FC E5              push hl
1375+  56FD D5              push de
1376+  56FE C5              push bc
1377+  56FF             
1378+  56FF DD E5           push ix
1379+  5701 D1              pop de
